1
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,600
Someone is stealing Wu Shan's body.

2
00:01:10,520 --> 00:01:11,800
They're even stealing Wu Shan's body.

3
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,440
This person must be the mastermind.

4
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:14,440
Stop right there.

5
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:19,120
Running right after eating.

6
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,280
What kind of magical artifact is this?

7
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,640
The Xuantian Soul-Scattering Bell.

8
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,600
It's worth a hundred taels of gold.

9
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:26,260
It is one of the three treasures of Longhu Mountain.

10
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:33,440
What are you doing?

11
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:34,280
Daoist Master,

12
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:36,840
your trick of summoning souls to deceive people is quite good.

13
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:39,040
Summoning souls for salvation is definitely not a trick.

14
00:02:39,040 --> 00:02:40,440
I wonder if you, Daoist Master,

15
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:41,880
could teach me

16
00:02:42,040 --> 00:02:43,040
this trick.

17
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:48,040
The secret lies in the candles.

18
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:51,760
The candles here

19
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:53,760
are all mixed with a special hallucinogenic incense.

20
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,440
As soon as it burns to the part with the incense,

21
00:02:55,440 --> 00:02:57,480
the flame turns green.

22
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,760
Once inhaled, it causes hallucinations.

23
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:01,760
That's how these ghosts came about.

24
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:04,000
But as soon as the bell is rung,

25
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,840
these ghosts will disappear.

26
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:07,720
Why didn't you say so earlier?

27
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:08,650
Did you learn it?

28
00:03:10,160 --> 00:03:11,290
Where are you going?

29
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,840
To uncover the truth.

30
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,770
Want to come?

31
00:03:45,600 --> 00:03:47,040
Are you Lady Hong?

32
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:51,000
Are you a human or a ghost?

33
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:55,160
I am a human.

34
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:57,760
No.

35
00:03:59,760 --> 00:04:01,000
I am a ghost.

36
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,200
Maybe not either.

37
00:04:06,160 --> 00:04:08,440
Allow me to introduce myself.

38
00:04:09,440 --> 00:04:10,880
My name is Lin Hongyuan,

39
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:14,720
the one you call

40
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:17,200
Lady Hong.

41
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:23,340
What are you doing?

42
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,080
Aren't you not afraid of ghosts?

43
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:25,760
Shut up.

44
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,640
I assume you have already heard the story

45
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,320
about me and that heartless man.

46
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:36,400
Now let me tell you the story

47
00:04:37,960 --> 00:04:39,640
about me and Lao San.

48
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:57,760
Chen.

49
00:04:58,200 --> 00:05:00,080
Let's embroider the poem you wrote yesterday

50
00:05:00,080 --> 00:05:01,680
into a pair of Xuanji charts.

51
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,200
Alright.

52
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:05,420
I was thinking the same thing.

53
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,520
Then we will have to trouble you, sir,

54
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:09,920
to embroider a pair of Xuanji charts for us.

55
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,840
What do you say,

56
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,400
Chen?

57
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,280
Let's never part.

58
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,280
Get out!

59
00:05:47,159 --> 00:05:48,220
If you don't leave,

60
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:50,520
my future will be ruined.

61
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:53,600
Sheng.

62
00:05:53,840 --> 00:05:54,770
I'm not leaving.

63
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,040
Chen Sheng,

64
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,170
you're not that kind of person.

65
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:01,840
Chen Sheng!

66
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,080
Chen Sheng!

67
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:22,840
You didn't die.

68
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:24,200
You survived.

69
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:25,320
Yes.

70
00:07:27,200 --> 00:07:28,320
I survived.

71
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,720
I was saved by Lao San,

72
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:32,200
and

73
00:07:34,520 --> 00:07:35,840
I lost my memory.

74
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,520
Who are you?

75
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,400
Who am I?

76
00:07:53,280 --> 00:07:54,440
Wifey.

77
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:57,400
I am your wife.

78
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:17,640
Looking back at that time,

79
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:21,080
it was perhaps the best days of my life.

80
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,400
He raised silkworms,

81
00:08:23,960 --> 00:08:25,490
and I supported the family.

82
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:27,640
Sometimes I think

83
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,880
it's quite nice to have no memory.

84
00:08:32,039 --> 00:08:33,640
You can't remember the good,

85
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,559
nor the bad.

86
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,480
Come back early.

87
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:01,440
In heaven, may we be birds flying as one.

88
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:06,040
Hanging this love knot,

89
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:07,400
I pray to heaven

90
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:10,340
that we are united in heart for three lifetimes.

91
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,520
Good times don't last.

92
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:18,180
The love knot I hung on the intertwined branches

93
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,680
became the disaster

94
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:23,040
that shattered the beauty.

95
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:37,680
I'm fine.

96
00:09:39,520 --> 00:09:41,760
The love knot under the intertwined branches

97
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:43,360
left me in a daze all day long.

98
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:46,680
But I didn't fully regain my memory.

99
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:49,240
Until one day,

100
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:51,120
I met him.

101
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,040
All right.

102
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,000
Chen,

103
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,440
let's never be apart.
